    "title": "MICROSERVICE-apiwizdoc-List Loyalty Loyalty Expires-v1-spec",
    "description": "This API allows businesses to retrieve the current status of loyalty program expirations. It serves as a useful tool for loyalty program managers and customer service representatives to monitor and manage customer loyalty expirations effectively. By accessing valuable data on when loyalty points or benefits will expire, companies can proactively engage customers and enhance retention efforts. Typical use cases include notifying customers of impending expirations or analyzing overall loyalty engagement strategies.",
